  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A trolley of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span> is moving with speed <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"u\"></span>. A load is dropped onto the trolley so that it immediately attaches to the trolley. The speed of the trolley and the load becomes <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span>.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the mass of the load?<br/><br/></p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{mu-v}{v}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{mu+v}{v}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{mu}{v}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{mv}{u}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
